on":1,"episode":6,"released":"2024-04-18T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"With Sol and Nechuma in danger, Halina attempts to find refuge for her parents; Mila learns to assimilate in Warsaw; Bella searches for solace at the AVL Factory; Jakob faces life alone in the Radom ghetto.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/azfKAzzpsLrBC8yBotN2cxg0Kba.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L1dlLVdlcmUtdGhlLUx1Y2t5LU9uZXMtJTI4MjAyNC0lMjkv.1.7","title":"Monte Cassino","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2024-04-25T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Halina and Adam prepare for impending violence in Warsaw; Genek embarks on a dangerous mission; Addy struggles to move on with the unknown fate of his family.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2IVylnLyxHU4HM2BoapQ53fwLZV.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L1dlLVdlcmUtdGhlLUx1Y2t5LU9uZXMtJTI4MjAyNC0lMjkv.1.8","title":"Rio","season":1,"episode":8,"released":"2024-05-02T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Halina's strength and hope are put to the test; Addy builds a new life in Rio; the end of the war triggers the Kurc family's final search for answers.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ciplOjotjCgPtdRLZ0Ugb3wj1dW.jpg"}]}}